SUMMARY:Citadel Contemporary Dance:  Winterreise
DESCRIPTION:TORONTO ARTS & CULTURE\n( This performance is ***SOLD-OUT*** )
 \n\n### Winterreise\n\n##### Laurence Lemieux & Citadel \\+ Compagnie \\| 
 Echo Chamber\n\nA solitary traveller wanders through a frozen world of mem
 ory and longing in this **moving adaptation of Franz Schubert’s *Winterr
 eise*.** Reimagined for violin\, piano\, and two voices\, the production i
 ntertwines live music and dance to explore love\, loss\, and the search fo
 r belonging in Schubert’s timeless song cycle.\n\n***Ticket link here: (
 $35-$45)***\n\n(you're purchasing for the Saturday November 28th--8pm\n\nh
 ttps://www.citadelcie.com/event/winterreise/\n\nMore info on Echo Chamber:
 \n\nhttps://www.echochambertoronto.com/\n\nJoin us for this 'winter journe
 y'!!
