 onnect.\n\nOur event will be inside Mademoiselle Raw Bar + Grill\nEnter th
 e venue and ask for the meetup/networking event.\n\nStyle Code: Business C
 asual/Upscale Trendy.\n\nCome out and socialize with other GTA Art lovers\
 , business professionals and entrepreneurs over drinks!\n\nWe have over 7 
