SUMMARY:December ART Crawl: Tour 3 top private galleries/spaces ($10 per p
 erson)
DESCRIPTION:TORONTO ARTS & CULTURE\n**This is our last Art Crawl of 2026.*
 *\n\nWe'll re-start sometime in January 2027!\n\n***Please read everything
  over first.***\n\n\\*\\*\\*December 5th (1:00pm-3:00pm)\n\n12 people/memb
 ers this time.\n\nSTARTING in the DUPONT & Bathurst area.\n\n**$10 per per
 son.**\n\n**\\*\\*\\*Sent via e-transfer when you signup/rsvp.**\n\n**I'm 
 not able to HOLD space for you.**\n\n***--We will visit 3 different*** (do
 wntown/west end/east end) galleries each month **(with short walks between
  each one)**\n\nEach month will be different galleries and/or artist-run c
 entres.\n\n\\*\\*We'll meet the Gallery owners/artists/directors--\nwho wi
 ll lead us in tours and conversation at each stop.\n\nNO weather cancellat
 ions---**we will carry on!**\n\nNO cancellations/no refunds or any re-sche
 duling if you cannot make it.\n\n\\-\\-\\-Check your calendars and PLAN ah
 ead if you can join us\\-\\-and please be on time\\. We're not able to wai
 t for you\\. Sorry\\.\n\nAre you interested in ART/artists--**and learning
 /visiting**\n**the exceptional local commercial galleries we have in Toron
 to? With other MEETUP members.**\n\nSaturday December 5th ***(1pm-3pm)***\
 n\nOnce I have 12 **confirmations** from Meetup members (you)--I will emai
 l you the specifics of our Route.\n\nIf interested\, please email me $10.\
 n\nInclude your first name only\, and email address for a reply.\n\n**I wi
 ll then confirm you.**\n\nAnd will firm up our itinerary with you next wee
 k.\n\nYou can email me directly here:\n\ntorontoisculture@gmail.com\n\nGre
 g\n\nThank you.
